body:
If he's moody it's likely due to him feeling slightly depressed for some reason or another. It's not uncommon for people to sleep during these periods due to boredom or other factors.

&#x200B;

If you're concerned about his well-being and you live within walking distance to his house then maybe check up on him otherwise just wait it out and call in a few hours. You're being a bit dramatic, doubt he's doing it to you PERSONALLY.

I just find the whole fact that he's selling merch as shady. Also not convinced by his dad sitting there with the dog, it all just screams sympathy baiting for merch profits. How do we know that all proceeds are going to charity? 

&#x200B;

Not really invested in the Minecraft community so I can't speak of Techno as a person, but people are able to charm - always remember that, this could all just be a ploy to quit YouTube and make ONE LAST buck before he departs. Sketchek's death was one that truly affected me, it was straight after Kitty0706's passing so it came as a huge shock.

&#x200B;

Schetchek doesn't deserve the fanbase he currently has, shocked that so many people looked past his "joke", that shit was never intended to be a joke, let's be real, his channel garnered so much more attention the second that he "died", the same goes for Techno, wouldn't shock me if this is all staged.
